data_AF-TEST-F1
#
# A hand-trimmed AlphaFold mmCIF: six residues out of the real
# https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-O60566-F1-model_v6.cif, with three edits made on
# purpose so the parser's edge cases are exercised offline:
#
#   * residue 4 is absent, so `covered` must report [[1, 3], [5, 6]] rather than [[1, 6]].
#   * residue 5 is UNK (an unknown residue), which must read as the one-letter code "X".
#   * residue 6 carries a second alternate location (label_alt_id B), which must be
#     dropped instead of overwriting the first coordinate for that residue.
#
# The coordinates and pLDDT values of residues 1-3 are the real file's, verbatim; 5 and 6
# are the real file's residues 5 and 6 with the comp_id / alt_id edits above. Public
# reference data either way — an AlphaFold model is the same for every human.
#
loop_
_struct_conf.beg_auth_asym_id
_struct_conf.beg_auth_comp_id
_struct_conf.beg_auth_seq_id
_struct_conf.beg_label_asym_id
_struct_conf.beg_label_comp_id
_struct_conf.beg_label_seq_id
_struct_conf.conf_type_id
_struct_conf.end_auth_asym_id
_struct_conf.end_auth_comp_id
_struct_conf.end_auth_seq_id
_struct_conf.end_label_asym_id
_struct_conf.end_label_comp_id
_struct_conf.end_label_seq_id
