_struct_conf.pdbx_end_PDB_ins_code
A ALA 2 A ALA 2 TURN_TY1_P   A ALA 3 A ALA 3 TURN_TY1_P1   ? ?
A VAL 4 A VAL 4 HELX_RH_AL_P A LYS 6 A LYS 6 HELX_RH_AL_P1 ? ?
A MET 1 A MET 1 STRN         A ALA 2 A ALA 2 STRN1         ? ?
A ALA 3 A ALA 3 BEND         A ALA 3 A ALA 3 BEND1         ? ?
#
loop_
